The word list data in this directory (words.json) is derived from the
New General Service List Project word lists:

  New General Service List - Graded Reader (NGSL-GR 1.0)
    by Browne, C., and Culligan, B.
  TOEIC Service List (TSL 1.2)
    by Browne, C., and Culligan, B.
  Business Service List (BSL 1.2)
    by Browne, C., and Culligan, B.
  New Academic Word List (NAWL 1.2)
    by Browne, C., Culligan, B., and Phillips, J.
  New General Service List (NGSL 1.2), via the English definition file
    by Browne, C., Culligan, B., and Phillips, J.

Source: https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/

